---
// Who We Are section — bilateral bridge layout with corridor cards
---
<!-- =====================================================================
     WHO WE ARE
     ===================================================================== -->
<section id="why" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-hairline relative overflow-clip">

  <!-- Slides in from off the right edge at the top of the section -->
  <span class="slab restored-slab" data-scrub="enter" aria-hidden="true"></span>

  <div class="shell band relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-[clamp(34px,4.4vw,68px)]">

    <!-- Header: Title and copy from the nested project -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.15fr)] gap-x-[clamp(28px,4vw,64px)] gap-y-6 items-start">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <p class="kicker reveal">Who we are</p>
        <h2 id="about-title" class="display d-lg reveal" style="--d:80ms">
          The bridge between<br>Ghana and Europe.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-body text-[15.5px] leading-[1.7] reveal" style="--d:140ms">
        <p>
          AI Hub, Ghana is a not-for-profit initiative connecting Ghana's growing artificial intelligence ecosystem with Europe. Ghana brings strong AI talent, entrepreneurial energy and government backing through its National AI Strategy. The Hub creates a structured route to European markets.
        </p>
        <p>
          We help European organisations access Ghanaian talent and solutions, while connecting Ghanaian companies and professionals with European clients, projects and partnerships.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bilateral corridor design cards -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5" id="corridor">
      <!-- Europe – Ghana -->
      <div class="bg-mint-tint panel-hook-tr-bl p-[clamp(26px,3vw,44px)] flex flex-col gap-6 reveal on-colour">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <svg class="w-[22px] h-[22px] text-teal" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><use href="#i-plane-landing"/></svg>
          <span class="text-[10.5px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#26654D]">Europe – Ghana</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="heading text-[clamp(20px,2vw,28px)]">For European organisations</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col">
          <li class="border-t border-[#BFD9CD] py-[15px] text-[14.5px] font-semibold">Vetted Ghanaian AI professionals and teams</li>
          <li class="border-t border-[#BFD9CD] py-[15px] text-[14.5px] font-semibold">Cost-effective delivery capacity for practical AI work</li>
          <li class="border-t border-[#BFD9CD] py-[15px] text-[14.5px] font-semibold">Transparent governance and EU AI Act readiness support</li>
          <li class="border-y border-[#BFD9CD] py-[15px] text-[14.5px] font-semibold">An on-the-ground presence in Accra</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Ghana – Europe -->
      <div class="bg-coral-tint panel-hook-tl-br p-[clamp(26px,3vw,44px)] flex flex-col gap-6 reveal on-colour" style="--d:110ms">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <svg class="w-[22px] h-[22px] text-[#A83E32]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><use href="#i-plane-takeoff"/></svg>
          <span class="text-[10.5px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#A83E32]">Ghana – Europe</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="heading text-[clamp(20px,2vw,28px)]">For Ghanaian talent and ventures</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col">
          <li class="border-t border-[#E0B0A8] py-[15px] text-[14.5px] font-semibold">European clients and project work</li>
          <li class="border-t border-[#E0B0A8] py-[15px] text-[14.5px] font-semibold">Training and certification to international standards</li>
          <li class="border-t border-[#E0B0A8] py-[15px] text-[14.5px] font-semibold">Incubation support for AI-enabled ventures</li>
          <li class="border-y border-[#E0B0A8] py-[15px] text-[14.5px] font-semibold">Placement on international assignments</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mission note -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-5 pt-1 reveal" style="--d:180ms">
      <span class="w-11 h-11 bg-gold rounded-bl-[24px] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.75] text-body max-w-[90ch] m-0">
        We support young Ghanaian companies with AI tools, training and incubation to help bring their ideas to market. All surpluses are reinvested in AI skills, jobs and businesses.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- The four-colour corridor bar, reading Accra to Europe -->
  <div class="corridor reveal" data-scrub="enter" aria-hidden="true">
    <i class="bg-coral" style="width:26%"></i>
    <i class="bg-gold"  style="width:22%"></i>
    <i class="bg-mint"  style="width:24%"></i>
    <i class="bg-teal"  style="width:28%"></i>
  </div>
</section>
